This directory contains a minimal regression example for the
``fix uvt`` style in the EXTRA-FIX package.

Files:

- ``in.electron_uvt`` runs a quadratic toy model with an analytic
  constant-potential equilibrium.
- ``in.electron_uvt_restart`` continues from the restart written by
  ``in.electron_uvt`` and can be used to check restart continuity.

Build LAMMPS with the EXTRA-FIX package enabled before running this
example.

Run ``in.electron_uvt`` first so that ``in.electron_uvt_restart`` can
read the generated ``uvt.restart`` file.
